            "en": "“श्वः गमिष्यामि,” you say, and Lubdhaka's purse slowly rolls off the root, spilling no coins: it was never full. He stares at it. “I did not expect,” he says carefully, “a child who plans.” The Vetāla swings with delight. “A forward-looker. A forward-looker!”",
